  "releaseNotes": "A. We have added the DigitalCustomers Namespace that includes all classes and methods dedicated to AADE's Digital Customer Base.\n\t\n\tB. Sending B2G invoices through invoicing providers has been normalized according to the latest KED changes.\n\t\n\tC. Class myDATATools\n\t   1. The method getClientServiceType has been added.\n\t   2. The method getVehicleMovementPurpose has been added.\n\t   3. The method getProvidedServiceCategory has been added.\n\t   4. The method getDclInvoiceKind has been added.\n\t   5. The method getDclOffSiteProvidedServiceType has been added.\n\t   6. The method getDclReasonNonIssueType has been added.",
